OL,3,GNEWSACounty's children's services rated
OL,4,A'outstanding'
OL,5,
OL,6,FLincolnshire's children's services team
OL,7,Fhas been rated as "outstanding" for the
OL,8,Fthird consecutive time.
OL,10,FFor the first time, Lincolnshire County
OL,11,FCouncil was also given top Ofsted
OL,12,Fratings in every category it was
OL,13,Fassessed in for its help, care and
OL,14,Fprotection of children and young
OL,15,Fpeople.
OL,17,FSome of the successes in the report
OL,18,Finclude children in care being "well
OL,19,Fcared for and making excellent
OL,20,Fprogress" as well as "consistently
OL,21,Feffective and tailored support" for
OL,22,Fcare leavers.
OL,23,APub: 25-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,386,380,200,160,0,100
