OL,3,GNEWSACounty's children's services rated
OL,4,A'outstanding'
OL,5,
OL,6,FHeather Sandy, the council's executive
OL,7,Fdirector of children's services, said:
OL,8,F"Our staff go above and beyond, day in,
OL,9,Fday out, to support the families they
OL,10,Fwork with. It's wonderful to see their
OL,11,Fefforts praised in this way."
